todd@toddgalley.com wrote:
> cleared out the castle and ready to head down but can't figure out how
> to take my pet with me as there are no stairs.  my pet can fly so i
> can't push him into a hole.  i do have saddle and can ride him, i also
> have a magic whistle.  are there any suggestions on bringing him
> along?  thanks (don't usually get this far and am a little excited!)

If you have just a single pet it's no problem; magic whistle it above
the stairs then displace it. If you fall through the trapdoor while it
is adjacent it will follow you down. Another option is, if you have
levitation, just levitate to the trapdoor square and remove levitation
when your pet is close to you. If you can ride you may as well do that;
to fly down with your pet just hit the '>' key. BTW, there's one trap
that is adjacent to the two doors to the store rooms; there you can
take up to four adjacent pets with you down in one turn. Other options
are to level teleport down (with teleport control and a cursed scroll
of teleportation, e.g.).

Have fun! It's quite exciting down there :-)

